 as the head of that community. It also attained referential status through a grand program of theogonic invention and revision. This involved the integration of deities from different backgrounds and ritual fields across the region into a standardized and universalized pantheon, and the cultivation of learning and intellectual pursuit that was associated with the several schools (cults) of these deities."'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 896, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 729})
