e started only with the massive population movements from the Mainland close to the end of the Bronze Age, and even then it took a long time: even in Classical times the Cretan cults retained more peculiar traits, inherited from the Minoan past.” '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 879, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 768})
