ular is also forbidden on the Shabbat. His former teacher, the great Tosafist, Rabbi Isaac b. Samuel of Dampierre (RI), added that he did not understand why this kind of reading should be permitted even on weekdays, since it comes under the category of prohibited recreation. These expressions of rabbinic anxiety suggest that Jews were obviously doing this in northern France." '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 909, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 800})
